<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>20-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 5 minutes. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C2A-M01"><h3>Question 1 · A shared household task</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天的家务怎么分？你打扫客厅，我洗碗，好吗？</p><p class="cn">我更想洗碗，客厅请你打扫，可以吗？</p><p class="cn">好，那就这样。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M02"><h3>Question 2 · When the activity begins</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">社区活动星期六十点开始。我九点要在家打扫厨房，九点半出门。活动十二点结束以后，我再去买菜。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M03"><h3>Question 3 · A regular household job</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我平时每天晚上洗碗，星期六和星期日不用洗，因为这两天爸爸做家务。我每个星期洗五次，每次大约十分钟。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M04"><h3>Question 4 · A walk after work</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你平时六点散步，今天也一样吗？</p><p class="cn">今天六点要开会，七点才下班。我想下班后走半个小时。</p><p class="cn">那我七点在楼下等你。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M05"><h3>Question 5 · A change to the evening</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">小安最近每天晚上看电视到十二点，第二天起床总觉得累。昨天她十点就关了电视，今天早上起床的时候觉得舒服多了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M06"><h3>Question 6 · A destination before lunch</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你现在去市场吗？</p><p class="cn">不是，我先去图书馆还书。还完书再到对面的市场买菜，中午回家做饭。</p><p class="cn">那我在图书馆门口等你。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M07"><h3>Question 7 · Choosing transport</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">去图书馆坐地铁只要十分钟，我们坐地铁吧。</p><p class="cn">今天地铁站不开门，还是坐公交车吧，二十分钟能到。</p><p class="cn">好，我去车站等你。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M08"><h3>Question 8 · After leaving the bus</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">从车站到图书馆怎么走？</p><p class="cn">下车后先向右走，到第一个路口再向左。图书馆就在银行旁边，不用过马路。</p><p class="cn">好，我记住了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M09"><h3>Question 9 · A route with two needs</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">去图书馆有两条路。走河边比较近，可是没有灯；走商店那边远五分钟，但是一路都有灯。</p><p class="cn">现在天黑了，我不着急，走商店那边吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M10"><h3>Question 10 · Rain changes a plan</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天上午下雨，原来九点在公园见的活动怎么办？</p><p class="cn">改在图书馆吧。不过图书馆十点才开门，我们十点半见。</p><p class="cn">好，就这么定了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M11"><h3>Question 11 · How much food</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们四个人，一人一碗面，好吗？</p><p class="cn">我和哥哥想吃米饭，妈妈和妹妹吃面。</p><p class="cn">那就两碗面、两份米饭，再点一个菜。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M12"><h3>Question 12 · Choosing a size</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这件小号的衣服好看，你试过了吗？</p><p class="cn">试过了，太小。我想买大号，颜色还是蓝色，不要红色。</p><p class="cn">好，我帮你找蓝色大号。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M13"><h3>Question 13 · The price on the order</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这份午饭十五块，汤另外三块。</p><p class="cn">我只要午饭，不要汤。给你二十块。</p><p class="cn">好的，午饭十五块，找你五块。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M14"><h3>Question 14 · A suitable shared dish</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">小林不吃辣，小周不吃肉，晚上点什么好？</p><p class="cn">辣牛肉不行。鸡蛋面没有肉，也不辣，十八块；白菜汤虽然便宜，但大家想吃面。</p><p class="cn">那就点鸡蛋面。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M15"><h3>Question 15 · After the grocery order</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">家里没有牛奶了，你下班后去买两瓶吧。</p><p class="cn">我今天五点要开会，商店六点关门，恐怕来不及。</p><p class="cn">那我现在去，你晚上回来洗碗就好。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M16"><h3>Question 16 · The afternoon weather</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天早上有点儿冷，还下了小雨。天气预报说下午不下雨了，会出太阳，最高二十度。我们下午再去公园，不用现在出门。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M17"><h3>Question 17 · Why the activity moved</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">周日天气很好，为什么不在公园做活动？</p><p class="cn">公园的门坏了，周日不开。我们改在社区中心，时间还是下午两点。</p><p class="cn">原来是这样。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M18"><h3>Question 18 · Enough time to walk</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我今天想散步，但是只能走二十分钟。</p><p class="cn">去湖边来回要四十分钟，小区里的路来回十五分钟。你走完以后还可以休息一会儿。</p><p class="cn">好，就在小区里走。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M19"><h3>Question 19 · The order of festival activities</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">上周我们去社区参加春节活动。先看小朋友唱歌，再跟老师写汉字。写完字以后，大家一起吃午饭。我第一次参加这样的活动，觉得很有意思。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2A-M20"><h3>Question 20 · A small sign of enjoyment</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2a-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">第一次去社区春节活动的时候，小雨只想待半个小时。后来活动结束了，她还在问下次什么时候再办，又告诉妹妹下次一定要一起来。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期六一起吃午饭吧。你有什么不想吃的，或者不能吃的东西？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">店里有米饭，也有面条。你想选哪一种？也可以选别的。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你为什么想这样选？请给我说一个理由。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">我十二点有事，一点才能到。你方便吗？不方便的话，可以怎么改？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>